{% comment %}Public customer reviews from Dolce's Opinew feed. Featured cards are 5-star CO reviews; aggregate remains unfiltered. Snapshot: 19 November 2026.{% endcomment %}
<section class="dr" id="dolce-reviews-{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="dr-title-{{ section.id }}" hidden>
 <div class="dr__intro"><div><p class="dr__eyebrow">EL LADO MÁS REAL DE DOLCE · COLOMBIA</p><h2 id="dr-title-{{ section.id }}">Ellas ya lo<br><em>hicieron suyo.</em></h2></div><div class="dr__rating"><span data-dr-average></span><div><span class="dr__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span><p data-dr-total></p><small>Calificación general de la tienda</small></div></div></div>
 <div class="dr__feature" data-dr-feature></div>
 <div class="dr__bar"><p>Opiniones de <strong>5 estrellas</strong><span>De clientas de Dolce en Colombia</span></p><div class="dr__controls"><button type="button" data-dr-prev aria-label="Opiniones anteriores">←</button><button type="button" data-dr-next aria-label="Más opiniones">→</button></div></div>
 <div class="dr__rail" data-dr-rail tabindex="0" aria-label="Opiniones de cinco estrellas de clientas colombianas"></div>
 <p class="dr__note">Opiniones sobre compras en Dolce. Cada testimonio indica su producto; las fotos y videos pertenecen a la reseña correspondiente.</p>
